Design references
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MIMI's interface is designed from scratch. The following projects were studied
as references for interaction and visual patterns and were built under
GPL-3.0 or Apache-2.0:

  kushagrasinghx/BitChord         GPL-3.0    Now Playing layout / motion
  lladlam/MeloX-Android           GPL-3.0    Now Playing structure
  cosmictaserdev-creator/Convx    GPL-3.0    Player morph / drag motion
  misa198/Airmedy                 GPL-3.0    Design language
  chrisbanes/haze                 Apache-2.0 Frosted glass
  Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass       Apache-2.0 Glass controls

No source files from the projects above are included in this repository at this
time. They are credited as design references only.
